<EditorialShell title="SM'S DEX | Interactive Portfolio by Shivam Mahajan" description="Explore SM'S DEX, Shivam Mahajan's interactive Astro portfolio, accessible device controls, and public roster." eyebrow="Move 002 / Astro" heading="Building SM'S DEX" intro="An interactive portfolio inspired by nine game generations. Visitors can submit a public roster entry through GitHub for review.">
  <a slot="actions" href="/">Explore devices</a><a slot="actions" href="https://github.com/smresponsibilities/smresponsibilities.github.io">View source</a>
  <section><h2>Why this interface</h2><p>The device format gives each generation a distinct way to explore the same portfolio. The readable view keeps the content accessible when the device presentation is inconvenient.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Device controls</h2><p>Visitors can switch generations, open or close the device, turn its screen off, and choose a readable view. Sound starts off. Reduced-motion preferences are respected.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Public roster</h2><p>The Add Pokémon form opens a prefilled GitHub issue. A workflow validates the submission and creates a pull request for review before the entry joins the roster.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Tradeoffs</h2><p>Animated devices take more effort to navigate than a plain document. The site therefore includes an HTML <a href="/resume/">resume</a> and direct links to project evidence.</p></section>
</EditorialShell>
